# Ignore everything
*

# Except these
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!LICENSE
!README.md

# Skills are published one at a time, on purpose. This repo is PUBLIC, and skills
# are where machine paths, cluster hostnames and private-project internals collect.
# `!skills/*/` only lets git descend into the skill dirs - git does not track empty
# directories, so a skill stays local until it gets its own `!skills/<name>/**` line.
!skills/
!skills/*/

!skills/audit/**
!skills/decision-board/**
!skills/doublecheck/**
!skills/handoff/**
!skills/hpc/**
!skills/plan/**
!skills/task/**
!skills/triage/**

# The rules below must stay under the `!skills/...` lines, since the last matching rule wins.

# decision-board reads its private Site configuration from ~/.codex/decision-board/. These keep
# a stray copy of it, and Site project files that hold its identity or local state
# (.openai/hosting.json, .wrangler/, node_modules/, dist/), from being published with site/.
skills/decision-board/site.json
skills/decision-board/site/.*
skills/decision-board/site/node_modules/
skills/decision-board/site/dist/

# Python bytecode caches inside published skills.
__pycache__/
